   "about": "Light Binding in flight. Ours: league_lux_fx:q_orb, a LinearProjectile picture the game turns to the flight (drawn pointing right, centred on the head), 4 frames x 70 ms looped. Seen from straight above at sprite scale (0.2 px a unit, as our heroes are drawn; at the kit's 0.1 League's orb is a 3-px dot); the missile flies 300 units/s here instead of 1200 so its 0.5 s trails stay as long as our picture's (a projectile's picture never moves by itself). Frames from 0.55 s into the flight. The arch-shaped ground glows are left out: the picture turns with the projectile, a glow on the ground would turn too. Its sparkles (rays, hoop1 / hoop2 bokeh, Sparks_, Left / Left1 motes) are left out too: at 2 px a game px they turned the orb into confetti (tried: dev/q_orb_lod.png).",
